{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"b69c Phase 4a contract cards frozen. Happy card — authority: ticket durable-state/status contract and ADR-0031 prior-art seam; preconditions: real temp repo with origin, .env-id, mutating producer success; path: reconciler finalization writes real refs/reconciler/last-pass, then real rebar bridge status --json reads it; tier: producer/consumer contract + real Git ref + CLI subprocess because unit-only would miss serialization/ref/routing; postcondition: HEALTHY exit 0 with exact pass/env/outcome and unchanged tracker; gate: make test. Edge card — authority: ticket precedence/identity/CAS/detail contract; preconditions: real ref combinations plus selected env/max-age/pause/live lock and injected shared CAS mismatch; paths: real CLI/ref reader and existing concurrency/CAS seams; postconditions: exact PAUSED>RUNNING>FOREIGN>FAILED>STALE>HEALTHY, NEVER_RUN only with no witnesses, alias parity, hard .env-id errors, one rolling matching detail, three attempts with 100/200ms and loud non-CAS failure, lock released; negatives: omitted max-age and unrelated inbound legacy identity/workflow default remain unchanged; collateral: refs/tracker bytes unchanged by status; gate: make test. Canary E2E card — authority: ticket two-witness lease/cutover contract; preconditions: fetched real refs/reconciler/* and status snapshots with advancing or stationary lock OID/fence; path: canary entrypoint with real rebar status subprocess, fake only sleep/snapshot transition and GitHub rollback API; postcondition: advancing=>RUNNING/no alert, same OID+fence across observed lease=>CRASHED/stale escalation, lease>480 immediate failure, default status makes no heartbeat API call, explicit github-api preserves old behavior; collateral: ticket escalation/dedup lifecycle unchanged; gate: make test. Surface census — CLI canonical+hidden alias: in scope; automated reconciler/canary: in scope; dual writer/read witness: in scope; MCP/API: out (no bridge control operation exists); public library facade: out (same reason). Existing preview/sync/pause/resume held-out coverage is retained as compatibility proof. Collected/executed/gate evidence will be logged after RED."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786305712525661001,"uuid":"e2898852-72ce-4cdc-9be4-9f3a7b7043fc"}